{"id":"ics-047","stemHtml":"<p>下面三组声明里，<code>int</code> 占 4 字节，二维数组按行优先存放。按本课程的约定，把 <code>a</code> 的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times4=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span> 个 <code>int</code> 看成一块连续的 48 字节内存：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">int a[3][4];\nint b[12];\n\nint *p = &amp;a[0][0];   /* 按上述约定，p 可在这 12 个 int 上做指针算术 */\nint *q = &amp;a[2][3];\nint *r = b;          /* 指向一维数组 b 的首元素 */</code></pre></p>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<p>(1) <code>sizeof(a)</code>、<code>sizeof(a[0])</code> 各是多少？<code>a[1] + 1</code> 的类型是什么，指向哪个元素？</p>\n<p>(2) <code>q - p</code> 和 <code>&amp;a[1][2] - p</code> 的值分别是多少？它们的单位是字节还是元素？</p>\n<p>(3) <code>p[7]</code> 是哪个元素？用二维下标写出它。</p>\n<p>(4) 判断下面的表达式是否合法、是否属于未定义行为（UB），并说明理由：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">r + 12;      /* (1) */\nr + 13;      /* (2) */\n*(r + 12);   /* (3) */\n*(r + 11);   /* (4) */\na[3][0];     /* (5) */</code></pre></p>\n<p>(5) C 标准为什么允许&quot;指向数组末尾后一个位置&quot;的指针（one-past-the-end），却不允许多走一个？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>二维数组 <code>a[3][4]</code> 的类型是&quot;3 个 <code>int[4]</code> 的数组&quot;，在内存里是 12 个连续的 <code>int</code>。<code>a[i]</code> 退化为指向该行首元素的 <code>int*</code>。</p>\n<p>二维下标与一维序号的关系：<code>a[i][j]</code> 就是第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4i+j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span> 个 <code>int</code>。</p>\n<p>指针相减得到&quot;元素个数&quot;；判断指针算术是否合法时，看它指向的那个数组对象有多大——<code>b</code> 是 12 个 <code>int</code> 的数组，这是判断 (1)–(4) 的基准。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> <code>a</code> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 的 <code>int</code> 数组：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof}(a)=3\\times4\\times4=48\\ \\text{字节},\\qquad\n\\texttt{sizeof}(a[0])=4\\times4=16\\ \\text{字节}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<code>a[1]</code> 的类型是 <code>int[4]</code>，在表达式里退化为指向首元素的 <code>int*</code>，所以 <code>a[1] + 1</code> 是 <code>int*</code>，指向 <code>a[1][1]</code>（相对 <code>a</code> 的字节偏移 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16+4=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 把二维下标映射到一维序号：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⟷</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[i][j]\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ 4i+j.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟷</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<code>p</code> 指向 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[0][0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>（序号 0），<code>q</code> 指向 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[2][3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>（序号 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times2+3=11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span>），所以</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q-p=11.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>同理 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[1][2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> 的序号是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times1+2=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span>，所以 <code>&amp;a[1][2] - p = 6</code>。指针相减的单位是<strong>元素</strong>（这里是 <code>int</code>），不是字节；要字节差才乘 <code>sizeof(int)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> <code>p[7]</code> 等价于 <code>*(p+7)</code>，序号 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7=4\\times1+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，即</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[1][3].</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 判断基准是&quot;指针指向的数组对象有多大&quot;：<code>b</code> 有 12 个元素，合法下标 0–11，末尾后一个位置是 <code>b+12</code>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(1) <code>r + 12</code>：指向 <code>b</code> 的 one-past-the-end，<strong>合法</strong>，可以参与比较、相减，但不能解引用。</li>\n<li>(2) <code>r + 13</code>：越过 one-past，指针算术本身就越界，属于 <strong>UB</strong>（不需要解引用就已经 UB）。</li>\n<li>(3) <code>*(r + 12)</code>：解引用 one-past 指针，<strong>UB</strong>。</li>\n<li>(4) <code>*(r + 11)</code>：<code>b[11]</code>，在数组范围内，<strong>合法</strong>。</li>\n<li>(5) <code>a[3][0]</code>：<code>a</code> 的行下标只能是 0–2，<code>a[3]</code> 已经是越界访问，<strong>UB</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键的一步是区分&quot;指针值合法&quot;与&quot;解引用合法&quot;：one-past 指针可以存在、可以比较，但不指向任何对象，读写它就是 UB。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> one-past 让&quot;半开区间&quot;成为可能：C 里区间约定为 <code>[begin, end)</code>，<code>end</code> 正是最后一个元素的下一个位置。这样循环可以写成</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">for (int *it = r; it != r + 12; ++it) { ... }</code></pre></p>\n<p>不必在每次迭代里额外判断&quot;是不是最后一个&quot;。如果连 one-past 都不允许，<code>end</code> 指针就无法表达，循环边界要么多算一次、要么引入额外条件分支。</p>\n<p>但不允许再往后走：<code>r+13</code> 没有对应的数组对象，标准无法保证其算术结果有意义（某些平台上地址计算可能溢出或触发陷阱），因此规定为 UB。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>严格按 ISO C 的字面规定，<code>&amp;a[0][0]</code> 的指针算术边界只覆盖 <code>a[0]</code> 这一行（4 个 <code>int</code>）；把它当连续 12 个 <code>int</code> 使用是编译器与教材（含 CSAPP）普遍采用的约定，本课程的偏移计算也按这个约定。真要严格跨行访问，用 <code>(char *)a</code> 做字节算术，或直接用一维数组 <code>b</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","mistakesHtml":"<ul>\n<li>把 <code>q - p</code> 当成字节差 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\times4=44</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span></span></span></span>。指针相减的单位是元素个数；字节差要自己乘 <code>sizeof(int)</code>。</li>\n<li>把 <code>a[1] + 1</code> 的类型说成 <code>int**</code> 或 <code>int[4]</code>。<code>a[1]</code> 退化为 <code>int*</code>，加 1 仍是 <code>int*</code>。</li>\n<li>认为 <code>r + 13</code> &quot;只要不解引用就没问题&quot;。指针算术越界本身就是 UB。</li>\n<li>把 <code>*(r + 12)</code> 当成合法，因为&quot;它只是最后一个元素后面一个&quot;。one-past 可以取地址，不能读。</li>\n<li>认为二维数组 <code>a</code> 的元素是&quot;行&quot;，所以 <code>p+1</code> 跳到下一行。<code>p</code> 是 <code>int*</code>，<code>p+1</code> 是下一个 <code>int</code>；只有 <code>a+1</code>（类型 <code>int(*)[4]</code>）才跳一行。</li>\n</ul>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <code>sizeof(a)=48</code>，<code>sizeof(a[0])=16</code>，<code>a[1]+1</code> 是指向 <code>a[1][1]</code> 的 <code>int*</code>；(2) <code>q-p=11</code>，<code>&amp;a[1][2]-p=6</code>，单位是元素（<code>int</code>）不是字节；(3) <code>p[7]</code> 就是 <code>a[1][3]</code>；(4) <code>r+12</code>、<code>*(r+11)</code> 合法；<code>r+13</code>、<code>*(r+12)</code> 是未定义行为；<code>a[3][0]</code> 越界访问是 UB；(5) one-past 合法是为了支持半开区间与循环边界</p>\n"}